    "notes": "Algorab Store 5.5.1312 and Algorab Agent 5.5.1312 are the last versions built on Java.\n\nAlgorab Store on Java reaches the end of its support, and Algorab 6 replaces it: a new app written for macOS, and for Windows and Linux. The Store now shows a notice when it starts and a banner in the sidebar, with one button that takes you to Algorab 6. Nothing moves by itself: the Store no longer replaces itself automatically, and the move happens only when you press the button. Mods keep installing and updating as before.\n\nA Mac that cannot run Algorab 6 is told why and stays on this version. If an update of the Store fails, the working copy is now moved aside safely before anything is restored.\n\nHalia's description in the Store is updated. Algorab Agent 5.5.1312 has no functional change.",
